# .pyz changes: three hypothesize() calls per finding now, not one -- discovery+skeptic,
# security, root-cause -- every resulting evidence row tagged with which role produced it.
#
# A correction found before writing code: this session's own proposal for `security` first
# described it as producing SEMANTIC_REACHABILITY evidence. Wrong -- in de_v2/core.py's own
# taxonomy that type sits beside STATIC_ANALYZER/DETERMINISTIC_REPRODUCER/RUNTIME_DETECTOR/
