# Tagging an ATOM answer with it would claim a rigor never performed -- the same mistake
# classify/confidence/expect would have been in D-0284. security and root-cause therefore
# add AI_HYPOTHESIS rows exactly like discovery, and neither attempts a transition past
# HYPOTHESIZED.
#
# reproducer/patch-review, the remaining two declared roles, stay explicitly out of scope:
# both need real code execution, and NOESAR EVOLUTION's own EXECUTE sandbox (D-0249/D-0250/
# D-0253) stays deliberately disabled per installation -- the Owner declined to enable it as
# a side effect of this feature.
#
